---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy Policy – ReNaval"
  description="Privacy policy and data protection guidelines for clients, vendors, and users of ReNaval."
  canonical="https://renaval.com/en/privacy/"
>
  <Navbar lang="en" />

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#F8FAFC] pt-28 pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <nav class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/en/" class="hover:text-[#0A4B75] no-underline">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-[#0A4B75] font-semibold">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="bg-white border border-[#e2e8f0] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm">
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#2D3137] mb-2">Privacy & Data Protection Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-8">In accordance with Law 1581 of 2012 (Republic of Colombia) | ReNaval</p>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[#0A4B75] mb-2">1. Data Controller</h2>
            <p>
              <strong>ReNaval – Soluciones Integrales de Ingeniería</strong>, domiciled in Barranquilla, Colombia, is the data controller responsible for personal and commercial information collected through this website and official business channels.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[#0A4B75] mb-2">2. Purpose of Data Collection</h2>
            <p>
              Information collected via contact and quote forms (name, company, email, telephone, project details) is used exclusively for:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li>Preparing and submitting engineering proposals and commercial quotations.</li>
              <li>Coordinating field technical surveys and project operations.</li>
              <li>Customer service and contractual communications.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[#0A4B75] mb-2">3. Data Security and Confidentiality</h2>
            <p>
              ReNaval adopts strict administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to prevent unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure of submitted information. Technical specifications and project scopes are treated under strict commercial confidentiality.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[#0A4B75] mb-2">4. Exercise of Rights (Habeas Data)</h2>
            <p>
              Data subjects may at any time exercise their rights to know, update, rectify, or request deletion of their personal data by emailing <strong>gerencia@renaval.com</strong>.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer lang="en" />
</Layout>
